{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:602f67a03d2408dc","name":"Niffla","source":{"id":"source:reference-602f67a03d2408dc","title":"Niffla","revision":20263,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:31:25Z","sha256":"2b4077e365362a8f33fb7cb9400cc22ffe2ea7e8b74b0287848364da9b4074b3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20263","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Niffla&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-602f67a03d2408dc","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Niffla is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Toydarian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Toydarian","referenceId":"reference:3470d92d0a6cef2e"}," infomerchant and Imperial informant known to work the Hub shipyards at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dac","referenceId":"reference:8654fc7bdc8fd9cb"},". She's in it for the credits, and she'll deal with anyone- Imperial officers, high-ranking politicians, or criminals. She admits that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," pays the best, especially for information regarding the Alliance Remnant, Admiral Stazi's fleet, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},", or their sympathizers. She's also tasked with keeping an eye on suspected ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," freedom fighters. She's sneaky, stealthy, and underhanded. She works alone, mainly because she doesn't trust anyone.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Niffla spies on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gial Gahan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gial_Gahan","referenceId":"reference:c6403aa375231b89"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Monia Gahan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Monia_Gahan","referenceId":"reference:3bd7179fb946e7d3"}," for the Empire prior to the theft of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Imperious"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperious?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Although she receives a hefty fee for the information she provides, Niffla is forced to remain on board Admiral Valan's flagship- in the brig- until the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," are lured into a trap. Niffla languishes in the brig for days before anyone thinks to release her after the trap fails spectacularly. Niffla takes the hint and disappears from Imperial view, setting out to find new buyers for her information, at least until her small part in the disastrous plan is long forgotten.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Niffla Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Small ",{"tag":"a","children":["Toydarian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Toydarian","referenceId":"reference:3470d92d0a6cef2e"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}